//@version=6
//
// OUR CODE: plots the broker's position (the D19 adoption probe, impl-08 T16) and enters long
// while flat.
strategy("boot view (strategy-pine T16)", overlay = true)
plot(strategy.position_size)
if strategy.position_size == 0
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
